     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "带巧妙储物件的小厨房",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "70333977"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c2/d0/c2d05a9feaccb7517b6397a2218e525b.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c2/d0/c2d05a9feaccb7517b6397a2218e525b.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>运用小空间储物方法</strong> 即使小厨房也放得下必备用品。可以用挂杆悬挂厨房用品（在伸手可及的范围内尽量挂高些，让空间更显宽敞），再加一辆手推车。这比大尺寸的橱柜节省空间，手推车还可随心推到树屋的任何地方。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "堆着多个枕头的单人床",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "70231323"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6d/be/6dbe52c72d778142d2b0fda1efe28c0d.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/6d/be/6dbe52c72d778142d2b0fda1efe28c0d.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>小空间多功能解决方案</strong> 将枕头用作靠垫，树屋中的睡眠区域就可瞬间变为休息区。用夹式射灯，灵活照明。夹式射灯既不占用地面和桌面空间，又可随心调整照明方向，哪里需要增加亮度就调向哪里，尤其适合睡前阅读。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "阳台上的小椅子",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "90143189"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1f/3a/1f3a071c018a6fcf5b56b3fa520cf458.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1f/3a/1f3a071c018a6fcf5b56b3fa520cf458.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>户外小坐</strong> 环绕树屋的阳台空间或许略显狭小，但足以让你饱览美景。白天搬一张轻盈的小椅子到阳台上，即可打造户外休闲空间。</p>"
   ],
